.\" sermoia-mcp.1 — man page for sermoia-mcp
.\" haplo-dialog <devel@haplo-dialog.fr>
.\" Installed as /usr/share/man/man1/sermoia-mcp.1
.TH SERMOIA-MCP 1 "October 2026" "sermo @PACKAGE_VERSION@" "sermo User Commands"
.SH NAME
sermoia-mcp \- MCP server that has an AI assistant write, check and see sermo dialogs
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sermoia-mcp
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sermoia-mcp
is a Model Context Protocol server. It speaks JSON-RPC on its standard input and
output and is started by an MCP client (an AI assistant), not by hand.
It gives the assistant six tools:
.TP
.B sermo_schema
the tags and attributes of the sermo XML language;
.TP
.B sermo_check
parse a dialog and report the first error;
.TP
.B sermo_run
open a dialog for a person and return the values they entered (runs the
commands of the dialog, and says so);
.TP
.B sermo_render
draw a dialog as a picture without running any of its commands;
.TP
.B sermo_examples
search the catalogue of examples, including the job scripts and toolboxes;
.TP
.B sermo_vote
record that an example helped or misled.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SERMO_BIN
sermo binary used by check, run and the text preview (default:
.BR sermo ).
.TP
.B SERMO_RENDER_BIN
binary used by render (default: SERMO_BIN). A port that renders without a
display, such as qt6sermo, needs no X server.
.TP
.B SERMO_EXAMPLES_DIR
example catalogue (default: the installed one).
.TP
.B SERMO_VOTE_FILE
vote register (default:
.IR $XDG_STATE_HOME/sermoia/votes.tsv ).
.TP
.BR SERMOIA_CHECK_DELAI ", " SERMOIA_RENDER_DELAI
timeouts in seconds (defaults 20 and 30, at most 120 and 300).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/sermoia-mcp/examples
the example catalogue.
.SH EXAMPLE
.nf
claude mcp add sermoia --env SERMO_BIN=/usr/bin/gtk3sermo \e
  --env SERMO_RENDER_BIN=/usr/bin/qt6sermo -- /usr/bin/sermoia-mcp
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sermo (1),
.BR sermoman-mcp (1),
.I /usr/share/doc/sermoia-mcp/README.md
.SH AUTHOR
haplo-dialog <devel@haplo-dialog.fr>
